# Not needed to build or run on Vercel (the CLI upload otherwise walks the
# working tree): the dev database the local server keeps writing, local
# build output, deps, logs and every env file. `vendor/` stays: it holds the
# packed jev-judge the build installs.
.pglite
.next
node_modules
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
coverage
launchd
